/-!
# Witness data for the marked Rudvalis comparison

These are untrusted tables derived from `source/comparison-witness.json` and
from the preserved ATLAS inverse-transpose matrices. Entry i of `orbitPacked`
is the vector attached to permutation point i, with its first coordinate in
the low bit. The sorted tables implement a candidate left inverse; the basis
coefficients express each coordinate vector in 28 selected orbit vectors.
The subsequent certificates prove every property used by the comparison.

Source and action conventions: `../source/README.md` and
`Theory/SpecificGroups/Rudvalis/Model/PermutationData.lean`.
-/

